    <p>For a Sheffield contractor, the build usually includes:</p>

    <ul class="trades-list-block">
      <li>An About page that grounds you in Sheffield specifically — what part of town you operate out of, how long you've been doing this work here, whether you grew up in the city or moved in. For a small market like Sheffield, local ties matter more than they do across the river</li>
